    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-editorial art direction, disciplined dark palette, sharp cyan/red accents, and a commanding headline. Responsive restructuring is coherent. However, desktop cards in the leftmost column are visibly clipped, tablet/mobile metadata and JSON are excessively small and dense, and the mobile header loses the brand name while presenting a visibly truncated navigation strip. The very tall mobile composition also weakens hierarchy and scanability.",
